# What never enters an image build's context (PRD-02 T4). The build needs the
# workspace's sources, manifests and lockfile and nothing else: everything
# below is either rebuilt inside the image, irrelevant to it, or must never
# leave this machine.

# Rebuilt in the image
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults

# Local state and secrets — an image never carries either
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
.cache
downloads
*.log
test-results

# Reference material is never imported by code (CLAUDE.md), and the clones
# under it are gigabytes of somebody else's repository.
references

# History, CI and editor noise
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store

# The loop's own files: PRDs, progress notes, runner scripts.
ralph
